<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see sunny, warm weather.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see sunny, warm weather.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies Wednesday were forecast to see sunny and warm weather, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see sun with afternoon cloudy periods with highs of +15 Celsius in the north to +23 in the south.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see sun with highs of +8 to +17 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see sun with highs of 0 to +10 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
